<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="ps-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Problems it solves</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Three everyday problems Secure, Managed Infrastructure takes off your plate.</p></div>
