<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:#E6E0F5;color:#5B3E9A;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#5B3E9A">monitor_heart</span></span><div><b style="font-size:17px">Monitoring, backups and maintenance</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:4px">Plus updates. All managed for you.</p></div></li>
