<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#8A5A00">Step 2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We connect your services</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Each HazirMinds service you use runs inside it.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:#A23E1E">Step 3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">We monitor and maintain it</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Monitoring, backups, maintenance and updates are on us.</p></li>
