<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">Straight answers</p><h2 id="lane-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-wrap:balance">What's in place, and what isn't yet</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">We'll never claim a certification we don't hold.</p><a href="/security" style="color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:8px">Security &amp; data protection →</a></div>
